# DroneVPS - back to the flight 238 configuration.
#
# Every line here is a parameter MEASURED to differ between the FC
# as it stands and the configuration that flew as flight 238 with no
# failsafe. Nothing is in here because I thought it mattered.
#
# LEFT OUT (2) - today's level calibration:
#     AHRS_TRIM_X  AHRS_TRIM_Y
# LEFT OUT (1) - it SKIPS arming checks. The GPS pre-arm has to be answered by injecting, not by switching the check off:
#     ARMING_SKIPCHK
# LEFT OUT (2) - barometer hardware id:
#     BARO1_DEVID  BARO2_DEVID
# LEFT OUT (2) - ground pressure, set at every boot - an old one makes altitude wrong:
#     BARO1_GND_PRESS  BARO2_GND_PRESS
# LEFT OUT (32) - today's compass calibration:
#     COMPASS_CAL_FIT  COMPASS_DEC  COMPASS_DIA2_X  COMPASS_DIA2_Y
#     COMPASS_DIA2_Z  COMPASS_DIA3_X  COMPASS_DIA3_Y  COMPASS_DIA3_Z
#     COMPASS_DIA_X  COMPASS_DIA_Y  COMPASS_DIA_Z  COMPASS_ODI2_X
#     COMPASS_ODI2_Y  COMPASS_ODI2_Z  COMPASS_ODI3_X  COMPASS_ODI3_Y
#     COMPASS_ODI3_Z  COMPASS_ODI_X  COMPASS_ODI_Y  COMPASS_ODI_Z
#     COMPASS_OFS2_X  COMPASS_OFS2_Y  COMPASS_OFS2_Z  COMPASS_OFS3_X
#     COMPASS_OFS3_Y  COMPASS_OFS3_Z  COMPASS_OFS_X  COMPASS_OFS_Y
#     COMPASS_OFS_Z  COMPASS_SCALE  COMPASS_SCALE2  COMPASS_SCALE3
# LEFT OUT (3) - internal compass stays off, at the pilot's word:
#     COMPASS_ORIENT3  COMPASS_USE2  COMPASS_USE3
# LEFT OUT (1) - the RC switch owns this, not a file:
#     GPS_PRIMARY
# LEFT OUT (22) - today's accelerometer and gyro calibration:
#     INS_ACC1_CALTEMP  INS_ACC2OFFS_X  INS_ACC2OFFS_Y  INS_ACC2OFFS_Z
#     INS_ACC2SCAL_X  INS_ACC2SCAL_Y  INS_ACC2SCAL_Z  INS_ACC2_CALTEMP
#     INS_ACCOFFS_X  INS_ACCOFFS_Y  INS_ACCOFFS_Z  INS_ACCSCAL_X
#     INS_ACCSCAL_Y  INS_ACCSCAL_Z  INS_GYR1_CALTEMP  INS_GYR2OFFS_X
#     INS_GYR2OFFS_Y  INS_GYR2OFFS_Z  INS_GYR2_CALTEMP  INS_GYROFFS_X
#     INS_GYROFFS_Y  INS_GYROFFS_Z
# LEFT OUT (5) - the speeds changed on 30 Oct, on purpose:
#     LOIT_SPEED_MS  PILOT_SPD_UP  WP_SPD  WP_SPD_DN
#     WP_SPD_UP
# LEFT OUT (1) - a different mission:
#     MIS_TOTAL
# LEFT OUT (1) - the FC learns this in flight:
#     MOT_THST_HOVER
# LEFT OUT (6) - today's RC calibration - an old one breaks the sticks and the switch:
#     RC14_MAX  RC14_MIN  RC14_TRIM  RC2_MAX
#     RC3_TRIM  RC4_MIN
# LEFT OUT (2) - the demo site, typed on the RC:
#     SCR_USER1  SCR_USER2
# LEFT OUT (5) - counters - boot count, flight time:
#     STAT_BOOTCNT  STAT_DISTFLWN  STAT_FLTCNT  STAT_FLTTIME
#     STAT_RUNTIME

